		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>White-furred humanoid shape with a rabid elk's head and stumps for legs. Unclean spirit that drifts in the air, seeking mortal flesh.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 52, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 claws +10 (2d8 + wendigo curse), <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Wendigo Curse</strong>. Mortal beings touched by the wendigo, CHA 15+ or 1d4 WIS damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 WIS, corpse transforms into wendigo at midnight.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
